{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:488a6b35f429b06d6a424c03f7b370a0684a7505058de0c678ed37a369bb61a6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0c6836055e4cd1eee00a24582964c9a2d206689addccfb6655acaaf5f5c590",
      "text": "甜甜的香气、努力与友情！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1659fe408b29902069f8b82e8b25074eaf56919370699503e58e598161628e68",
      "text": "朱雀最近很在意玄武身上\n散发出的甜甜香气。但对方却说\n毫无头绪。\n然而实际上，玄武正为了朱雀的生日\n悄悄推进着某项准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a783542519b4c73f3acd944f7f92d183d27d3be53a0f55a32189b0a814cbff3",
      "text": "那么……\n朱雀的庆生准备，\n到这里也算大致就绪了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbb7fcca47603b3ca0c942214c14c89eaa172731a1506f92525c5cb1186374aa",
      "text": "多亏了英雄大哥，\n我总算能做出\n让人满意的松饼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b4bd374ebf4214ff4fab0f6137e39c8667a8ece6dea5e0ccc0c2a17f9c6e94a",
      "text": "画龙点睛。\n剩下就等朱雀过来，\n端出刚出炉的松饼招待他就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:801f44b1f23aaec7401adae796b739e4405a975205325aed686d0bedd81346b4",
      "text": "联络他也拜托番长了，\n差不多也到了朱雀\n抵达事务所的时间了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1456f07bdc4538b94cbe8eb06ab015f1bba4249e0ca8e6b475a5f2bfdf33b5f7",
      "text": "……朱雀那家伙，\n到底会露出怎样的表情\n开开心心地接受呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a20efb6337b035583f907a41bd084ad3803c11d04f272db7f72ade9ea99be73",
      "text": "为了今天，你居然一直都在\n练习做松饼啊。\n这也太不容易了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e524b7bd9b1d95e55cdb71cabbfe856ce94d056cf43a0d0418682dcd9b43d398",
      "text": "在做出理想的松饼之前，\n我试过各种食谱呢。\n比如加点豆腐之类的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f0e3a244f4481713f88aff329f32a6e4c069fb02c8d239b372aa9f3018def47",
      "text": "豆腐！？加进松饼里吗？\n完全想象不出来啊，\n到底会是什么味道……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb157ebdde84257d4d504d732d79204e8fc27847ae63c863e2c93c49f9bf6ecb",
      "text": "倒不是味道会变，\n而是饼身会变得蓬松。\n那种也相当不错呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81a2c6acf4ff1d79a65fde77b418a34f1fbb5acdc556b784a4e8896bf06bd2b2",
      "text": "嘿，那可真让人燃起来了啊！\n筋道和软糯的我都很喜欢，\n蓬松的也想尝尝看啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_x_025suz_2_1_2_025_12:1_2_025_12:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c7ce27bff67379979c23e308f0bbf4014fd05c68a9096090a53283f54065c85",
      "text": "那下次我就煎那种给你吃吧。\n你吃得津津有味的那副表情，\n我也还想再看一次呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
